Named prerequisite readings

The seven included AN-03 and AN-04 chapters contain independently written AI programme text dedicated to CC0 1.0. Their original authorship, references, hypotheses and review scopes are retained. Inclusion supplies the named readings used by this course; it does not certify every result of either parent course. Linked lower chapters and illustrations are included only where explicitly supplied.

The historical FSF license document in an03-notices/COPYING is preserved verbatim under its own copying terms. It does not impose GFDL on these AI-written chapters.

